+ * Build the 20-byte request payload that follows the `0xa3` opcode :
+ *   [class:1][pad:3=00 00 00][tuid:16]
+ *
+ * Both transports share this shape — the DT path drives it through the
+ * CONTROL vtable (`verimark_storage_delete_object` below) ; the IT path
+ * drives it raw on BULK EP01/EP81 (`verimark_delete` in verimark.c).
+ * The caller emits the leading opcode separately (e.g. via
+ * `verimark_session_encrypt_appdata`).
